stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Ready
  Ready --> Pending: Mark done
  Pending --> Recovery: Missing or invalid receipt
  Recovery --> Pending: Retry same request
  Pending --> Confirmed: Event receipt and exact readback
  Pending --> Recovery: Readback fails
  Pending --> Recovery: Stale version
  Confirmed --> Pending: Undo original event
  Pending --> Ready: Exact reopen receipt and readback
  Pending --> Unavailable: Operation unavailable
  Ready --> Retired: Authorization retired
  Pending --> Disposed: Dispose before reply
